            <note corresp="#d92-f3" n="3" xml:id="d92-f3-content">
                <p>The draft communiqué, which described the establishment of a “permanent
                    delegation” to the High Authority, was transmitted to the Department of State in
                    telegram Polto 209 from Paris, Aug. 26. (740.5/8–2652)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
